   ],
   "spoken": "The opponent hasn't castled — and any time your opponent's king is stuck in the centre, the alarm bells for tactics should ring. An uncastled king by definition means a heightened chance of a combination.",
   "kind": "plan"
  },
  {
   "ply": 21,
