   "line": [
    "e6"
   ],
   "spoken": "Here's the common pattern to bank — if the enemy queen lands on the open central file, a rook to e1 wins it. Combining that with the exposed king yields the pawn thrust to e6, which forces a capture, and the recapture keeps the tactic alive because the queen can't take without walking into the rook.",
   "kind": "tactic"
