   "spoken": "The best practical defence is simply to capture the pawn and accept being slightly worse — less of the centre, but solid. Sometimes admitting a small disadvantage and staying sturdy beats clutching at an unsound alternative.",
   "kind": "plan",
   "reanchor": true
  },
  {
